---
manual: styles.kerning
lines: [1275, 1280]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 200 do
  flow { @tight = para "IIII", size: 20 }
  flow { @spaced = para "IIII", size: 20, kerning: 5 }
end
----------- test code
extra = layout_of(para("@spaced")).w - layout_of(para("@tight")).w
assert (14.5..20.5).cover?(extra), "5 pixels more between each of four letters: 15 in all, or 20 if the last letter gets them too; got #{extra}"
